# Per-package build environment overrides.
#
# llvm-core/llvm + llvm-core/clang are memory-hungry enough to OOM-crash the host
# at the global MAKEOPTS=-j28 (mesa[llvm] -> radeonsi, be+gpu role). Cap their job
# count via env/llvm-lowmem.conf. (Modern Gentoo category is llvm-core, not the old
# sys-devel; the small *-common meta-packages don't compile so they don't need it.)
llvm-core/llvm   llvm-lowmem.conf
llvm-core/clang  llvm-lowmem.conf
